    "/apis/v1/quickenrich/people-email-find": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Provide linkedin_url OR company_url + first_name + last_name. When all four are supplied, LinkedIn lookup runs first, then name/company fallback. All calls are synchronous. No dedicated SMTP verification endpoint.\n\n<!-- aisa-pricing:start -->\n按用量计费；默认请求预估费用：$0.004834 USD（不是固定价格）。 最终费用以账户适用价格及实际结算为准。\n<!-- aisa-pricing:end -->",
